                      "blocks": {
                        "text_6rQYtf": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "text": "<h2>ORDER PROCESSING</h2><p>Please allow 3 business days for orders from our online shop to be processed.</p><p>Once your order has been shipped you will be notified by email with the carrier and/or tracking number.</p><p>We try to keep everything displayed in our online store in stock but occasionally things sell out after a busy weekend. If this happens we will notify you, and do our best to have your item in stock within 10-14 business days or issue a refund.</p><p> </p><h2>SHIPPING</h2><p><strong>Shipping on orders over $150 pre-tax placed from online surf shop is free to our customers within Canada and will be shipped via regular post.</strong></p><p>For International Shipping, estimated delivery time is 14 business days <strong>not including the time spent clearing customs</strong>.</p><p>Storm's Online Surf Shop is not responsible for any customs fees, duties or taxes that are charged upon entry into your country.</p>",
